haz edilmesi lâzım gelen ahlâk ve a'mali saliha esaslarını tesbit eden ve nihayet yine tevhid emrini te'kid ile şirki müaheze edecek olan bervechiâti evâmir ve nevahi dikkat ediniz ne güzel hikmetlerdir: <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"437\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 437.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 9.7 9.7 16.4 35.3 35.3 47.3 47.3 63.0 63.0 73.4 73.4 80.3 89.3 89.3 96.7 103.4 111.7 111.7 119.3 126.0 126.0 132.7 150.0 150.0 156.7 163.4 163.4 170.3 170.3 186.0 186.0 190.4 198.0 198.0 213.7 220.4 220.4 228.7 228.7 237.7 237.7 244.4 244.4 251.3 267.0 271.4 279.0 294.7 311.3 311.3 311.3 318.0 335.3 346.4 346.4 360.7 367.4 384.7 398.3 409.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 23.3 80.3 103.4 132.7 163.4 190.4 251.3 271.4 279.0 294.7 318.0 360.7 367.4 420.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 20.3 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg></p>"}